 rounds from August 29 through October 25\, 2026\, running every Saturday a
 nd Sunday plus Labor Day and Columbus Day. Nine weekends and two holiday M
 ondays of full-contact jousting\, artisan markets\, live entertainment\, p
 eriod food and drink\, and the kind of spectacle that draws tens of thousa
 nds to Lebanon each fall. Each weekend runs on its own distinct theme: Dra
 gons & Dungeons\, Faerie Ring Revels\, Pirates & Vikings\, Shirefolk\, and
  five others. New shows\, new shops\, changing menus. It's not the same fa
 ire twice.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/connecticut-renaissance-f
 aire-2
