DESCRIPTION:Join us for a five-week meditation series held within the peac
 eful setting of the Museum galleries. Open to all ages\, no experience nec
 essary. Each session offers an opportunity to pause\, breathe\, and settle
  into the comfort of presence alongside remarkable works of art. Attendees
  will be invited to quietly reflect and meditate with a favorite piece wit
 hin the selected galleries\, allowing art to inspire mindfulness\, curiosi
 ty\, and connection in the present moment. You can sign up for an individu
 al date below or the full five weeks.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/event
 s/meditation-galleries
